Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Ponkan, Pomelo, Red plum, Black tea-like\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           这是我们买到的第三支来自于Cajamarca区域的豆子，依然是很清甜的柑橘和核果特征，饱满多汁～相比蒙特万，圣图里奥这只更柔和，红糖和红茶茶感（还有一些烤红薯）更突出，很饱满厚实；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 41, 65);font-weight: bold;\">\n           特征关键词：黄色柑橘+红色核果+红茶感\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7S0n5Q6QGTxOt7fcwvWhXybN8TpxQTsWIqk4txDp2XgxFEq4cQia7QoMrwoYNLTxCx8bYzLlaCFjxA/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Cajamarca区域是上图顶上深蓝色部分，图片来源CAFE IMPORTS网站\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n            关于\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Café Flor de Santuario\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           圣图里奥之花农场坐落于秘鲁东北部的塔瓦科纳斯山区(Tabaconas)，其名源于当地一种珍奇花卉-这\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='line-height: 1.75em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           些被誉为塔巴科纳斯-\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           南巴莱国家保护区(Tabaconas Namballe National Sanctuary) 之魂的兰花，以其惊艳的花姿与馥郁的芬芳，赋予了农庄这个充满诗意的名字。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b5ZAtJWRL5ibEXiaiaQrs21ic6Pib8picjic5pQrl5UjGYn6qCGSrrSLptcDTicPd3567ka7U7JMVwqyGEwSxJqcd7NZs5Cia1mNCAekKF0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b7w3icxWVYlcHsjzFkMDNRbJ2DzezEsfPVuP41CHiaQfxML3eyjzIKdFARukpIUqgLWkOc6V0DjFXKExywFic5Kh9JlcMtEz7Fh50/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           2017年，Teodoro带着全家怀揣着对品\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           质的执着追求，开始了瑰夏咖啡的种植试验。依托山区凉爽的气候与高海拔的天然优势，令人欣喜的咖啡风味图谱由此诞生～细腻的花香调性、漂亮的酸质，以及层次繁复的甘甜余韵，赢得了众多专家与咖啡饕客的倾心赞誉。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b4IIibGlrmJueCtU9ccNNvXkU2bAGibcyu5k2MdRgWzhPxkyxAsSGygKm64TiauO70APb2qWocgvRwKAbCFNiaAPnuf0tF7WKPs29o/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           这批厌氧水洗瑰夏以第36名的成绩闯入2025秘鲁CoE国际赛段，虽抱憾未能晋级最终排名，但对农场而言，能够与众多优秀咖农同台竞技，并让自己的咖啡被看见、被认可，已是莫大的鼓舞。这份成绩单，是对过去八年坚守的最好回馈，也能让农场更加笃信：圣图里奥之花，终将在世界咖啡版图上绽放属于自己的光彩。\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<span>\n<span>\n<span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<span>\n<span>\n<span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<span>\n<span>\n<span>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n               获奖记录\n              </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<span>\n<span>\n<span>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n               Peru 2024 CoE\n              </span>\n<a class=\"wx_topic_link\" data-recommend=\"\" data-topic=\"1\" style=\"color: #576B95 !important;\" topic-id=\"mnua30cv-62zrxp\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                #23\n               </span>\n</a>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<span>\n<span>\n<span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          </span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: normal;font-size: 17px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
